@@s031 At the exam
@@s032 At the exam
@@s033 When the question speaks of <b>order of dependencies</b>, <b>prerequisites</b> or <b>order of computation</b> of a DP on a DAG, use the topological sort. Write the explicit order and the direction: <i>"in topological order: each arc goes from an earlier to a later vertex."</i>
